[NEW] &lt;p&gt;Discover easier ways to use Copilot in OneDrive&lt;br&gt;
The new Prompt Gallery offers ready-to-use prompts for common file tasks, helping you get started quickly, discover what Copilot can do, and customize prompts to fit your needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Access the Prompt Gallery from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Copilot button in (GA: October CY2026) — OneDrive, Microsoft Copilot (Microsoft 365)
